  m_Name: L1912_AppleProgressNotWorking
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exerciseNumber: 12
  exerciseName: AppleProgressNotWorking
  exerciseTitle: Apples progress not working
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459492
  exerciseText: Apple Quest progress is not working
  hintText: Is the progress really not working? Is it picking up Apples? Or is the
    issue on the UI display?
  solutionText: The logic for getting the progress is doing an int division which
    means the output will be an int. In order to get decimals we need to convert
    at least one of the elements in the equation into a float so we get a float as
    a result.
